:23.824">known </span><span begin="00:23.824" end="00:24.207">since </span><span begin="00:24.207" end="00:24.520">day </span><span begin="00:24.520" end="00:24.729">one </span><span begin="00:24.729" end="00:24.970">you </span><span begin="00:24.970" end="00:25.649">never </span><span begin="00:25.649" end="00:26.851">cared</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.497" end="00:30.124"><span begin="00:27.497" end="00:27.746">I </span><span begin="00:27.746" end="00:27.826">don't </span><span begin="00:27.826" end="00:28.250">know </span><span begin="00:28.250" end="00:28.955">everything </span><span begin="00:28.955" end="00:29.355">you </span><span begin="00:29.355" end="00:30.124">want</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.427" end="00:34.080"><span begin="00:30.427" end="00:30.613">I </span><span begin="00:30.613" end="00:30.858">can't </span><span begin="00:30.858" end="00:31.163">tell </span><span begin="00:31.163" end="00:31.396">if </span><span begin="00:31.396" end="00:31.562">you're </span><span begin="00:31.562" end="00:32.636">happier </span><span begin="00:32.636" end="00:32.818">with </span><span begin="00:32.818" end="00:33.421">them </span><span begin="00:33.421" end="00:33.634">or </span><span begin="00:33.634" end="00:34.080">not</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.455" end="00:37.154"><span begin="00:34.455" end="00:34.651">Put </span><span begin="00:34.651" end="00:34.846">on </span><span begin="00:34.846" end="00:35.049">a </span><span begin="00:35.049" end="00:35.627">face </span><span begin="00:35.627" end="00:35.873">it's </span><span begin="00:35.873" end="00:37.154">obvious</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.827" end="00:46.166"><span begin="00:39.827" end="00:41.265">I </span><span begin="00:41.265" end="00:41.520">know </span><span begin="00:41.520" end="00:41.781">that </span><span begin="00:41.781" end="00:42.201">you </span><span begin="00:42.201" end="00:43.384">said </span><span begin="00:43.384" end="00:44.745">goodbye </span><span begin="00:44.745" end="00:45.146">to </span><span begin="00:45.146" end="00:46.166">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.781" end="00:52.196"><span begin="00:46.781" end="00:47.005">But </span><span begin="00:47.005" end="00:47.286">tell </span><span begin="00:47.286" end="00:47.605">me </span><span begin="00:47.605" end="00:48.048">why </span><span begin="00:48.048" end="00:49.150">am </span><span begin="00:49.150" end="00:49.561">I </span><span begin="00:49.561" end="00:50.287">always </span><span begin="00:50.287" end="00:50.599">on </span><span begin="00:50.599" end="00:50.978">your </span><span begin="00:50.978" end="00:52.196">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.788" end="00:58.815"><span begin="00:52.788" end="00:53.084">Do </span><span begin="00:53.084" end="00:53.563">you </span><span begin="00:53.867" end="00:54.596">tend </span><span begin="00:54.596" end="00:55.325">to </span><span begin="00:55.325" end="00:56.386">regret </span><span begin="00:56.386" end="00:56.778">the </span><span begin="00:56.778" end="00:57.508">things </span><span begin="00:57.508" end="00:57.810">that </span><span begin="00:57.810" end="00:58.299">I </span><span begin="00:58.299" end="00:58.815">did</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.123" end="01:01.688"><span begin="00:59.123" end="00:59.292">Because </span><span begin="00:59.292" end="00:59.473">you </span><span begin="00:59.473" end="00:59.735">know </span><span begin="00:59.735" end="01:00.151">I'm </span><span begin="01:00.151" end="01:01.223">finally </span><span begin="01:01.223" end="01:01.688">free</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.993" end="01:03.078"><span begin="01:01.993" end="01:02.652">Yuh </span><span begin="01:02.652" end="01:03.078">aye</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.212" end="01:05.588"><span begin="01:04.212" end="01:04.394">What's </span><span begin="01:04.394" end="01:04.573">the </span><span begin="01:04.573" end="01:04.877">rush </span><span begin="01:04.877" end="01:05.588">baby?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.006" end="01:08.534"><span begin="01:06.006" end="01:06.237">I </span><span begin="01:06.237" end="01:06.382">don't </span><span begin="01:06.382" end="01:06.540">want </span><span begin="01:06.540" end="01:06.701">to </span><span begin="01:06.701" end="01:07.005">hear </span><span begin="01:07.005" end="01:07.189">all </span><span begin="01:07.189" end="01:07.436">the </span><span begin="01:07.436" end="01:07.812">damn </span><span begin="01:07.812" end="01:08.534">maybes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.884" end="01:12.561"><span begin="01:08.884" end="01:09.141">Telling </span><span begin="01:09.141" end="01:09.336">all </span><span begin="01:09.336" end="01:09.612">your </span><span begin="01:09.612" end="01:09.933">friends </span><span begin="01:09.933" end="01:10.117">that </span><span begin="01:10.117" end="01:10.279">you </span><span begin="01:10.279" end="01:10.655">never </span><span begin="01:10.655" end="01:10.846">met </span><span begin="01:10.846" end="01:11.021">a </span><span begin="01:11.021" end="01:11.396">man </span><span begin="01:11.396" end="01:11.853">like </span><span begin="01:11.853" end="01:12.561">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.950" end="01:14.600"><span begin="01:12.950" end="01:13.671">Like </span><span begin="01:13.671" end="01:14.600">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.600" end="01:17.126"><span begin="01:14.600" end="01:14.793">And </span><span begin="01:14.793" end="01:15.904">you </span><span begin="01:15.904" end="01:17.126">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.376" end="01:20.583"><span begin="01:17.376" end="01:17.712">I </span><span begin="01:17.712" end="01:18.024">may </span><span begin="01:18.024" end="01:18.400">not </span><span begin="01:18.400" end="01:18.735">be </span><span begin="01:18.735" end="01:19.134">the </span><span begin="01:19.134" end="01:19.538">one </span><span begin="01:19.538" end="01:19.870">that </span><span begin="01:19.870" end="01:20.153">you </span><span begin="01:20.153" end="01:20.583">want</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.952" end="01:24.383"><span begin="01:20.952" end="01:21.393">But </span><span begin="01:21.393" end="01:21.694">I'm </span><span begin="01:21.694" end="01:22.047">the </span><span begin="01:22.047" end="01:22.391">one </span><span begin="01:22.391" end="01:22.727">that </span><span begin="01:22.727" end="01:23.207">you </span><span begin="01:23.207" end="01:24.383">need</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.838" end="01:59.206"><span begin="01:52.838" end="01:54.353">I </span><span begin="01:54.353" end="01:54.671">know </span><span begin="01:54.671" end="01:54.999">that </span><span begin="01:54.999" end="01:55.394">you </span><span begin="01:55.394" end="01:56.502">said </span><span begin="01:56.502" end="01:57.968">goodbye </span><span begin="01:57.968" end="01:58.367">to </span><span begin="01:58.367" end="01:59.206">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.038" end="02:05.418"><span begin="02:00.038" end="02:00.214">But </span><span begin="02:00.214" end="02:00.497">tell </span><span begin="02:00.497" end="02:00.817">me </span><span begin="02:00.817" end="02:01.248">why </span><span begin="02:01.248" end="02:02.422">am </span><span begin="02:02.422" end="02:02.759">I </span><span begin="02:02.759" end="02:03.511">always </span><span begin="02:03.511" end="02:03.783">on </span><span begin="02:03.783" end="02:04.192">your </span><span begin="02:04.192" end="02:05.418">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.979" end="02:11.957"><span begin="02:05.979" end="02:06.280">Do </span><span begin="02:06.280" end="02:06.734">you </span><span begin="02:07.070" end="02:07.766">tend </span><span begin="02:07.766" end="02:08.613">to </span><span begin="02:08.613" end="02:09.613">regret </span><span begin="02:09.613" end="02:09.990">the </span><span begin="02:09.990" end="02:10.741">things </span><span begin="02:10.741" end="02:11.021">that </span><span begin="02:11.021" end="02:11.507">I </span><span begin="02:11.507" end="02:11.957">did</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.247" end="02:15.183"><span begin="02:12.247" end="02:12.437">Because </span><span begin="02:12.437" end="02:12.507">you </span><span begin="02:12.507" end="02:12.851">know </span><span begin="02:12.851" end="02:13.362">I'm </span><span begin="02:13.362" end="02:14.427">finally </span><span begin="02:14.427" end="02:15.183">free</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.500" end="02:26.273"><span begin="02:23.500" end="02:23.805">What's </span><span begin="02:23.805" end="02:24.212">on </span><span begin="02:24.212" end="02:24.675">your </span><span begin="02:24.675" end="02:26.273">mind?</span></p></div></body></tt>